# Files Terraform reads into resource definitions (the state machine's ASL, the dashboard's
# queries and text) keep LF in every working copy. With CRLF, templatefile()/file() and
# heredocs carry "\r" into what gets deployed, and a plan's result depends on the
# machine's core.autocrlf setting.
*.tf       text eol=lf
*.tpl      text eol=lf
*.insights text eol=lf
